          "title": "CTB KPUP 4.1. (Week 4, Workout 1)",
          "url": "/c/4-week-kipping-ctb-pull-up-programming/sections/579020/lessons/2182129",
          "description": "Today’s session is low volume, but high focus. Move with intention and use the slower pace to check in on your chest-to-bar form. Are you leading with the knees too early, or keeping a full scoop through the legs? Is your chest actually making contact? Watch your elbow position if they stay under the bar instead of pulling back, a clean pull gets much harder. This range doesn’t get trained often, so take the time to build it right. Precision now pays off later.",
